<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF 20-yr bond auction lowest price 100.50.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF 20-yr bond auction lowest price 100.50.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction of 400 billion yen in 20-year government bonds produced the following results, the Ministry of Finance said on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Lowest price	 100.50    Stop rate	   2.960 pct</p>
<p>Average price	100.53    Average yield     2.957 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   1.8188 trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	398.7  billion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 95.5719 pct</p>
<p>Issue date    April 21, 1997   Maturity    Sept 20, 2017</p>
</text>
